From d83e34c9f3fe82ffcd14124759cbb16b88a49a82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 23 May 2026 09:13:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix EIU UVM testbench: parallel injection, full channel
 config, scoreboard report
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- bkp_sequence.sv: add proper ETH2/3/4 header config (addr 10-30) with
  payload_len=100 so TX frames reach the 64-byte monitor parse threshold
- uart_tx_sequence.sv: remove NUM_PKTS plusarg override so parent-set
  num_packets is respected
- uart_main_sequence.sv: expose num_packets variable; remove hardcoded 50
- eiu_vseq.sv: restructure into 3 staged phases — serial config, true
  parallel injection (kwr + per-UART + per-ETH in separate fork threads,
  NRZ in background join_none), then post-injection BKP polling loop
- eiu_scoreboard.sv: change fork...join to fork...join_none so run_phase
  returns; add report_phase with formatted per-channel PASS/FAIL table
- eiu_base_test.sv: increase post-vseq drain to 100us; simplify
  report_phase to defer to scoreboard summary

https://claude.ai/code/session_01VYc6Gf6pcRgwKrYf5mwKL9
